<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Demande d'accès — CODIS</title>
    <!-- Favicon -->
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="{{ asset('images/icon.png') }}">
    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- FontAwesome -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('styles/register.css') }}">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="register-card">
        <div class="brand-logo-container">
            <div class="brand-logo">
                <img src="{{ asset('images/icon.png') }}" alt="CODIS Logo">
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="brand-title">Demande d'Accès</div>
                <div class="brand-sub">Votre compte sera activé par un administrateur</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        {% for message in app.flashes('danger') %}
            <div class="alert alert-danger">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-exclamation"></i>
                <div>{{ message }}</div>
            </div>
        {% endfor %}

        <form method="post" action="{{ path('app_register') }}">
            {{ include('_csrf.html.twig') }}
            <div class="form-row">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label class="form-label">Nom *</label>
                    <div class="input-wrapper">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-id-card"></i>
                        <input type="text" name="nom" class="form-control" placeholder="ex: KABAMBA" required>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label class="form-label">Prénom</label>
                    <div class="input-wrapper">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-id-card"></i>
                        <input type="text" name="prenom" class="form-control" placeholder="ex: Jean">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="form-row">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label class="form-label">Nom d'utilisateur *</label>
                    <div class="input-wrapper">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-user"></i>
                        <input type="text" name="username" class="form-control" placeholder="ex: jkabamba" required>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label class="form-label">Mot de Passe *</label>
                    <div class="input-wrapper">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-key"></i>
                        <input type="password" name="password" class="form-control" placeholder="8 caractères minimum" minlength="8" autocomplete="new-password" required>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="form-row">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label class="form-label">Email</label>
                    <div class="input-wrapper">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i>
                        <input type="email" name="email" class="form-control" placeholder="jean@codis.cd">
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label class="form-label">Téléphone</label>
                    <div class="input-wrapper">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-phone"></i>
                        <input type="text" name="telephone" class="form-control" placeholder="+243 810 000 000">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
                <label class="form-label">Pays</label>
                <div class="input-wrapper">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-globe"></i>
                    <select name="pays_id" class="form-select">
                        {% for p in paysList %}
                            <option value="{{ p.id }}">{{ p.nom }} ({{ p.devise }})</option>
                        {% endfor %}
                    </select>
                </div>
            </div>

            <p style="font-size: 12px; opacity: 0.75; margin: 4px 0 14px; line-height: 1.5;"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i> Après envoi, un administrateur vérifie votre demande et vous attribue un rôle. Vous pourrez vous connecter dès l'activation.</p>
            <button type="submit" class="btn-submit"><i class="fa-solid fa-paper-plane"></i> Envoyer ma demande</button>
        </form>

        <div class="auth-footer">
            Vous avez déjà un compte ?<br>
            <a href="{{ path('app_login') }}"><i class="fa-solid fa-right-to-bracket"></i> Se connecter ici</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
